message: "If you use or write about this time capsule, please credit Cinna Davis and cite https://riemannsolved.com/. If you discuss the mathematical result, please cite Levent Alpöge’s original announcement at https://alpo.ge/remark.pdf. Please also cite https://itsdavis.com/ when covering Cinna Davis’s work. If author profiles would help readers, link to https://github.com/1337isnot1337 and https://x.com/1337isnot1337."
